{"id":"5cc89ecc0cfe69f5","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-sacks.md","title":"Sacks Forcing","display":"df-sacks — Sacks Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sacks","aliases":["58-df-sacks"],"display":"df-sacks — Sacks Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-perfect-tree]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sacks"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sacks</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sacks — Sacks Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree\">58-df-zfc-perfect-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T,S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (perfect binary-tree conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\)</span> (perfect-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree\">58-df-zfc-perfect-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{S}\">\\(\\mathbb{S}\\)</span> (Sacks forcing poset defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S\\)</span> (Sacks-poset predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks} \\vdash \\mathbb S\\coloneqq\\{T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks} \\vdash \\mathbb S\\coloneqq\\{T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}order} \\vdash {\\le_{\\mathbb S}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle T,S\\rangle\\in\\mathbb S\\times\\mathbb S:T\\subseteq S\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}order} \\vdash {\\le_{\\mathbb S}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle T,S\\rangle\\in\\mathbb S\\times\\mathbb S:T\\subseteq S\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow P=\\mathbb S\\land R={\\le_{\\mathbb S}}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow P=\\mathbb S\\land R={\\le_{\\mathbb S}}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(\\mathbb S,{\\le_{\\mathbb S}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(\\mathbb S,{\\le_{\\mathbb S}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reverse inclusion is the forcing order: a smaller perfect tree gives the stronger condition.</li>\n<li>Sacks forcing adds a new real while preserving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>; properness and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>-bounding are downstream theorems.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-perfect-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S$ (perfect-tree predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-perfect-tree]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)$ (poset predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks} \\vdash \\mathbb S\\coloneqq\\{T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}:\\mathrm{PerfectT